      "summary": "Patient identity adapter. Aligns free-text {code} path param with canonical INSIGHT patient.id via internal REST lookup (GET /api/patients/lookup). Opt-in via DIAGNOSIS_PATIENT_LOOKUP=1; default disabled preserves prior diagnosis-local identity for self-check and offline tests.",
